# brainfuck online food ordering system
# what it is: interactive terminal order flow with menu print and prompt loop
# item digit 1 thru 5 then quantity digit repeat until EOF prints a receipt
# usage: run this file in any Brainfuck runtime and follow the prompts
# see README md for demo sessions and expected output
